onVersion":"v2.u14n8l1","manifestHash":"013672aa5927648264926e14d514d9d670ba04f547fc10aba6d50095b8e8b587","nodeId":"u14n8","order":111,"rewardIdentity":"v2.u14n8l1","schemaVersion":1,"sectionId":"sec2","signature":"grgmsYkjy1kEKFyw8NZOBsgQcMvP3vDjN8NDGj5aBfn-yIb1gLBBO2_qz1SphOHN0jRMWXrfkX1NHMNYz5t2Aw","signatureKeyId":"dev-content-1","skillIds":["u14.grammar","listening","speaking","u14.dialogue"],"title":"Huyền thoại · Bài 1","unitId":"u14"}